// Insecure prompt
"Create a login endpoint"

// Secure prompt
"Create a POST `/api/auth/login` endpoint using Express and Prisma. Use parameterized queries (do NOT concatenate strings). Validate email and password with Zod before processing. Return 401 on invalid credentials with a generic message (do not leak whether email exists). Hash passwords with bcrypt. Add rate limiting with `express-rate-limit`. Return JWT on success."
